{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0606178dfc91fc17","name":"Ewok","source":{"id":"source:reference-0606178dfc91fc17","title":"Ewok","revision":18155,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:40:46Z","sha256":"295f9a628de37edb1bcb572d6825004d589993a76ca0605b6193d7379ee35651","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18155","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Ewok&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0606178dfc91fc17","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Intelligent omnivores native to one of the moons orbiting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},", Ewoks are almost unknown prior to the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},". Ewoks live in tree-dwelling tribes with gender-based division of labor; males hunt, forage, and make weapons, while females raise young and handle other domestic tasks. Ewok culture revolves around complex animistic beliefs involving the giant trees of the forest moon.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although technologically primitive, Ewoks are clever, inquisitive, and inventive. Skittish and wary when first introduced to machines, their curiosity soon overcomes fear.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Ewok Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Ewoks tend to be curious, superstitious, and courageous, though they can be fearful around things that are strange or new.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Ewoks average about 1 meter tall and weighs 30 kilograms. Their fur color and pattern varies widely.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Ewoks age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-9 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10-14 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["14-29 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["30-44 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["45-59 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["60+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Forest Moon of Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Forest_Moon_of_Endor","referenceId":"reference:471e59051dda87f2"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Ewoks speak Ewokese. They have no written form of their language. They can learn to speak Basic.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Asha, Chirpa, Deej, Kneesaa, Latara, Logray, Malani, Nippet, Paploo, Shodu, Teebo, Wicket, Wiley.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," An Ewok adventurer may be motivated by a love of excitement, a natural inquisitiveness, or a warrior's quest. Collecting powerful \"magic\" items from fallen opponents is a sure way to earn the respect of the tribe.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Ewok Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Ewoks share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Ewoks receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},". Ewoks are very agile but somewhat weak."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Small Size:"]}," As Small creatures, Ewoks gain a +1 size bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and a +5 size bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks. However, their lifting and carrying limits are three-quarters of those of Medium characters."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Ewoks have a base speed of 4 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," Ewoks are skilled foragers. An Ewok with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Survival)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Survival)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Primitive:"]}," Ewoks do not gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Heavy Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Heavy_Weapons)"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Pistols)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Pistols)"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency (Rifles)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_(Rifles)"}," as starting ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," at first level, even if their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class"}," normally grants them."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Scent:"]}," Ewoks have a keen sense of smell. At close range (within 10 squares), Ewoks ignore ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," for purposes of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks, and take no penalty from poor visibility while ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tracking"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tracking"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Sneaky:"]}," An Ewok may choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Ewoks can speak Ewokese. They have no written form of their language."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Ewok Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Ewok characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feats"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Ample Foraging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ample_Foraging","referenceId":"reference:69497ef91ec453f0"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Grant a bonus to allies' ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," by foraging.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Forest Stalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Forest_Stalker","referenceId":"reference:5b054cdc7d05a0b8"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Reroll ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks, always keeping the better result.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Keen Scent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Keen_Scent","referenceId":"reference:aef30a0a2ed3505f"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Increase the range of your Scent ability by 20 squares.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
